7. Separate commercial arrangements

Permission under Section 4 or 5 must come from a separate written agreement
with Titans Forge LLC specifying the authorized activity and material.
Permission for one activity is not permission for the other unless the
agreement expressly says so. These community terms set no fee and authorize
no person or agent to accept a separate agreement on the Licensor's behalf.
Licensing inquiries: https://titans-forge.itch.io/.

